comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-10T20:58:39.520Z","harness:claude-code","Measured surface at filing time (2026-08-10): 55 .mjs files under scripts/ totalling 16,184 lines; 16 files match *gate*.mjs totalling 6,500 lines; 20 scripts invoke the pm CLI as a subprocess to recompute properties over .agents/pm. scripts/release/tracker-measurement-gate.mjs alone is 929 lines and holds 30 declarations across 5 hard-coded selector sources (dependency_kind, validate_warning, graph_profile, graph_finding, health_check) — none of which can address any population the graph ANALYTICS compute, so redundancy_count, articulation_count, bridge_count and community_count are computable and unbounded. A prototype adding a sixth source was written and reverted during this session precisely because the capability belongs in the SDK, not in a script: the same 80 lines of selector plumbing would have to be rewritten by every project that adopts pm."
body: ""
